---
/**
 * Testimonials.astro — Testimonios de Pacientes
 */
---

<section class="testimonials section" id="testimonials">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="testimonials__header">
      <span class="section-label" data-i18n="testimonials_label">Testimonios</span>
      <h2 class="section-title" data-i18n="testimonials_title">Lo que dicen nuestros pacientes</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle" data-i18n="testimonials_subtitle">La confianza de nuestros pacientes es nuestro mayor logro.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="testimonials__carousel">
      <div class="testimonials__track">
        <!-- Testimonial 1 -->
        <div class="testimonial-card">
          <div class="testimonial-card__quote-icon">"</div>
          <p class="testimonial-card__text" data-i18n="test1_text">Llegué con miedo al dentista y me fui con la mejor sonrisa de mi vida. El equipo de Familia Dental me hizo sentir en casa desde el primer momento. ¡Los recomiendo al 100%!</p>
          <div class="testimonial-card__stars">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <p class="testimonial-card__author" data-i18n="test1_author">María González</p>
          <p class="testimonial-card__service" data-i18n="test1_service">Carillas de porcelana</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Testimonial 2 -->
        <div class="testimonial-card">
          <div class="testimonial-card__quote-icon">"</div>
          <p class="testimonial-card__text" data-i18n="test2_text">Mis implantes quedaron perfectos. La tecnología que usan es increíble y el Dr. Mendoza es un verdadero artista. Recuperé mi confianza para sonreír.</p>
          <div class="testimonial-card__stars">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <p class="testimonial-card__author" data-i18n="test2_author">Roberto Sánchez</p>
          <p class="testimonial-card__service" data-i18n="test2_service">Implantes dentales</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Testimonial 3 -->
        <div class="testimonial-card">
          <div class="testimonial-card__quote-icon">"</div>
          <p class="testimonial-card__text" data-i18n="test3_text">Mis hijos aman ir al dentista gracias a Familia Dental. El equipo de odontopediatría es maravilloso y el ambiente es muy acogedor para los pequeños.</p>
          <div class="testimonial-card__stars">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <p class="testimonial-card__author" data-i18n="test3_author">Laura Ramírez</p>
          <p class="testimonial-card__service" data-i18n="test3_service">Odontopediatría</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Testimonial 4 -->
        <div class="testimonial-card">
          <div class="testimonial-card__quote-icon">"</div>
          <p class="testimonial-card__text" data-i18n="test4_text">El tratamiento de ortodoncia con alineadores invisibles cambió mi vida. Nadie nota que los uso y los resultados son espectaculares. ¡Gracias por todo!</p>
          <div class="testimonial-card__stars">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <p class="testimonial-card__author" data-i18n="test4_author">Daniel Torres</p>
          <p class="testimonial-card__service" data-i18n="test4_service">Alineadores Invisibles</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="testimonials__dots">
      <button class="testimonials__dot active" aria-label="Testimonial 1"></button>
      <button class="testimonials__dot" aria-label="Testimonial 2"></button>
      <button class="testimonials__dot" aria-label="Testimonial 3"></button>
      <button class="testimonials__dot" aria-label="Testimonial 4"></button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
